return {
    ["\n　　<Letter_Highlight>《大冒险家·格尔曼海上历险》</>\n　　借阅人：丹尼 \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>《机械制造工程基础》</>\n　　借阅人：菲利克斯\n　　……\n　　为了图书的正常流通，希望这些读者尽快归还所借图书，认真学习借阅相关的规章制度并遵照执行。"] = "\n　　<Letter_Highlight>\"Great Adventurer: Gehrman's Sea Adventures\"</>\n　　Borrower: Danny \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>\"Fundamentals of Mechanical Engineering\"</>\n　　Borrower: Felix\n　　……\n　　For the normal circulation of books, I hope these readers will return the borrowed books as soon as possible, study the rules and regulations related to borrowing carefully, and comply with them.",
    ["        听，这是因蒂斯民众的呼声！执政官罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，我喜欢这个称呼。\n        在这场与索伦家族的博弈中，我险胜一筹。但他们不愧是从第四纪存续至今的古老家族，底蕴和积累深厚得可怕。要不是因蒂斯深陷纷乱已久，民众的不满日益滋长，我根本无法点燃暴乱的火星，站到现在的位置上。\n        接下来，就是逐步推行那些我构思已久的政策。当然，首先是——\n        旧城区真是太脏了！爱国卫生行动必须尽快推广，首都下水道和公共厕所也要尽快改善。所有居民都要烧水喝、勤洗手，不许乱扔垃圾和随地大小便！\n        顺便，每个人都要接受义务教育，都要接受招生考试的毒打！每一个！\n        我要打造一个干净温馨、整洁明亮，处处是诗歌，家家有花草的首都特里尔。\n        但永恒烈阳教会那群家伙是傻子吗？\n        我保护贸易与推行新法的目的之一，就是为了与他们和解啊！和气生财的道理懂不懂？要追究谋权篡位的事到什么时候，他们果然是被太阳烤坏了脑袋——该死，有点想念故乡的烤脑花了。"] = "Listen, this is the voice of the Intis people! Consul Roselle Gustav, I like this title. \n In this game of chess against the Sauron family, I won by a narrow margin. But they truly deserve to be an ancient family that has survived since the Fourth Epoch; their foundation and accumulation are terrifyingly deep. If it weren't for the fact that Intis had been mired in chaos for so long and the people's dissatisfaction was growing daily, I would never have been able to ignite the sparks of rebellion and stand where I am today. \n Next, it is time to gradually implement the policies I have been conceiving for a long time. Of course, first is— \n The old city district is just too dirty! The patriotic health campaign must be promoted as soon as possible, and the capital's sewers and public toilets must be improved quickly. All residents must boil water to drink, wash their hands frequently, and are forbidden from littering or urinating and defecating in public! \n By the way, everyone must receive compulsory education and suffer the torture of entrance exams! Everyone! \n I want to build a clean, cozy, tidy, and bright capital of Trier, where poetry is everywhere and every home has flowers and plants. \n But are those guys in the Church of the Eternal Blazing Sun idiots? \n One of my purposes for protecting trade and promoting new laws was to reconcile with them! Don't they understand the principle that harmony brings wealth? How long are they going to pursue the matter of usurping power? They must have had their brains baked by the sun—damn it, I kind of miss the grilled brains from my hometown.",
