    ["<DecH>工艺：</>网纱衬里・灵质链饰・不规则斜裁裙\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mesh Lining · Spirit-quality Chain Ornament · Irregular Bias-cut Skirt \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>镂空蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Cut-out Lace\nEven if you are an accidental guest, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-and-white diamond-patterned gown and join the whimsical tea party.",
